      },
      "description": "ADR-0069: a case-insensitive literal substring search over each authorized memory's text (title, key claim and evidence excerpt, or a bare-string content), one hit per matching line, with ±1 line of context, the true totals over the caller's view and keyset paging. Not a recall mode: no ranking, no projection.",
